      "description": "Prepare for your Section 608 certification exam with the most comprehensive study app available. Whether you're going for Type I, Type II, Type III, or Universal certification, 608 Practice has everything you need to pass.\n\nOver 1,700 Practice Questions\nStudy from a question bank covering all four exam sections: Core, Type I, Type II, and Type III. Every question has four answer options and a detailed explanation, just like the real exam. New questions are added regularly.\n\nPressure-Temperature Chart Questions\nPractice reading PT charts the way you will on the real exam. An interactive chart covering R-22, R-134a, R-410A, R-404A, and R-32 is built right into the questions, and opens full screen with a tap. Calculate superheat, subcooling, identify refrigerants, and compare pressures across different refrigerants.\n\n5 Study Modes Per Section\n\n• Cram - Read through every question with the correct answer and explanation shown. Absorb the material before testing yourself.\n• Study - Answer questions at your own pace with instant feedback. Pick up where you left off, in one tap from the home screen.\n• Smart Practice - Uses spaced repetition to bring back questions right before you forget them. Questions you get wrong come back quickly, questions you know well are spaced further apart. Mastered questions are left out so you spend time where it matters.\n• Mock Exam - Simulate the real exam with 25 random questions. 72% required to pass, just like the actual certification test. Time it at 30 minutes, like the real one, or take it untimed. Skip a question, flag one to come back to, and see what's still unanswered or flagged before you submit. Review your answers with full explanations after each attempt.\n• Most Missed - See which questions you get wrong most often, organized by section. As you master questions, they leave the list automatically.\n\nTrack Your Progress\n• Score trend charts showing your improvement over time\n• Study streak counter to keep you motivated\n• Each section's status, from Getting started to Ready to pass, based on your practice and mock exams\n• Mastery tracking for every question (3 correct answers in a row = mastered)\n• Topics: see your weakest study areas across every section, and practice one with a tap\n• Best mock exam scores by section\n• Your recent Smart Practice and mock exam results\n\nSearch\nSearch across every question by keyword. Looking for questions about R-410A, brazing, or recovery? Find them instantly.\n\nPhones and Tablets\nOn a tablet or an unfolded foldable, sections sit side by side, and the PT chart sits beside the answers.\n\nStudy Reminders\nSet daily or weekly notifications to keep your study habit consistent. Choose your preferred time and frequency.\n\nEnglish and Spanish\nThe whole app, questions and explanations included, in English or Spanish.\n\nBackup & Restore\nSave your progress to a file, and restore it on a new device. No account needed.\n\nWorks Offline\nAll questions are stored on your device. Study anywhere, anytime, with no internet required. Questions sync automatically in the background when updates are available.\n\nUp to Date\nCovers all current regulations, including the AIM Act and the 2026 rule changes.\n\nPrivacy First\nNo account required. No personal data collected. All your progress stays on your device.\n\nThis app is an independent study tool and is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to any government agency. Practice questions are compiled from publicly available educational sources for study purposes only.",
